n, [OR] progestin, [OR] or DHEA in the eight weeks prior to randomization. \nUse of alternative therapies [OR] or natural products to treat postmenopausal symptoms in the four weeks prior to randomization. \nPalpable fibroids [OR] or uterine prolapse: Grade 2 or 3. \nCigarette smoking<|eot_id|>']
