y(diagnosed [OR] or under investigation) \nHaematological disorders (Anaemia, [OR] malignancy, [OR] bleeding disorders) \nWomen [AND] of child-bearing potential \nUse of corticosteroids/ [OR] other antithrombotic agents(warfarin) \nChronic liver disease (Cirrhosis, [OR] malignancy [OR] and patients with more than twice the upper limit of liver function tests) \nUnable to consent. \nUse of other investigational study drugs within 1 year prior to study entry \nPrevious participation in this study<|eot_id|>']
