ance test, enzyme [OR] and/or Q wave positive myocardial infarction, angiographic evidence ( >50% stenosis of one vessel), percutaneous [OR] or surgical coronary revascularisation. \nAged between 18 and 75 \nProvided written consent for participation in the trial prior to any study-specific procedures or requirements.<|eot_id|>']
