Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\n1. Patient has an allergy to nickel. \n2. Patient has a diagnosis of bowel obstruction, bowel strangulation, peritonitis, bowel perforation, local or systemic infection, ischemic bowel, carcinomatosis or extensively spread inflammatory bowel disease. \n3. Patient is participating in another clinical trial which may affect this study\'s outcomes. \n4. Patient has been taking regular steroid medication. \n5. Patient has contraindications to general anesthesia. \n6. Patient has preexisting sphincter problems or evidence of extensive local disease in the pelvis.       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\n1. Patient has an allergy to nickel.\nExclusion Criteria:\n 1. Patient has a diagnosis of bowel obstruction, [OR] bowel strangulation, [OR] peritonitis, [OR] bowel perforation, local [OR] or systemic infection, [OR] ischemic bowel, [OR] carcinomatosis [OR] or extensively spread inflammatory bowel disease.\n 2. Patient is participating in another clinical trial which may affect this study\'s outcomes.\n 3. Patient has been taking regular steroid medication.\n 4. Patient has contraindications to general anesthesia.\n 5. Patient has preexisting sphincter problems [OR] or evidence of extensive local disease in the pelvis.<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
1. Patient has an allergy to nickel.
Exclusion Criteria:
 1. Patient has a diagnosis of bowel obstruction, [OR] bowel strangulation, [OR] peritonitis, [OR] bowel perforation, local [OR] or systemic infection, [OR] ischemic bowel, [OR] carcinomatosis [OR] or extensively spread inflammatory bowel disease.
 2. Patient is participating in another clinical trial which may affect this study's outcomes.
 3. Patient has been taking regular steroid medication.
 4. Patient has contraindications to general anesthesia.
 5. Patient has preexisting sphincter problems [OR] or evidence of extensive local disease in the pelvis.
