chronic disorder \npregnancy \nlactation \ncreatinine level of 1,5 mg/dL or more \ngastrointestinal problems [OR] or musculoskeletal disorders that would [NOT] prevent them to follow the test diets [OR] or exercise interventions \nliver dysfunction [AND] with a factor of at least 3 above the upper limit of normal in AST [OR] and ALT levels \nthyroid dysfunction, [AND] with serum TSH out of normal limits \nuse of immunosuppressive drugs, [OR] corticosteroids [OR] or anorexigen<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Diagnosis of type 1 diabetes
Exclusion Criteria:
diabetes 
ischemic heart disease [OR] or any abnormality on treadmill stress test 
inflammatory [OR] or chronic disorder 
pregnancy 
lactation 
creatinine level of 1,5 mg/dL or more 
gastrointestinal problems [OR] or musculoskeletal disorders that would [NOT] prevent them to follow the test diets [OR] or exercise interventions 
liver dysfunction [AND] with a factor of at least 3 above the upper limit of normal in AST [OR] and ALT levels 
thyroid dysfunction, [AND] with serum TSH out of normal limits 
use of immunosuppressive drugs, [OR] corticosteroids [OR] or anorexigen
