R] or hepatic encephalopathy\nSevere coagulation disorder: prothrombin time <40% [OR] (or INR >1.7) or platelet count <30,000/mm3\nMedium [OR] or large sized gastric [OR] or duodenal varices\nCoexisting malignancy\nSevere cardiovascular disorder, [OR] renal failure, [OR] peritonitis, [OR] sepsis\nSevere erosive esophagitis, severe esophageal stricture, active gastric [OR] or duodenal ulcer\nContraindication to beta-blocker\nPregnancy\nRefusal to give consent to participate in the trial<|eot_id|>']
