ired immunodeficiency [OR] or ongoing therapy that cause immunosuppression \nEarlier participation in a clinical study performed with cis-UCA \nAny clinically significant laboratory test result \nSuspected current drug [OR] or alcohol abuse \nClinically significant illness during the 4 weeks prior to the first dose administration \nAny other condition that in the opinion of the Investigator would interfere with the evaluation of the study results [OR] or constitute a health hazard for the patient \nUnwillingness [OR] or doubtful capacity to comply with the protocol \nDoubtful availability to complete the study<|eot_id|>']
