nt organs other than seminal vesicles (T4)\nProstate volume > 100 cc\nNodal involvement\nMetastatic disease\nPrior pelvic radiotherapy except as part of combination therapy for prostate cancer\nHistory of scleroderma\nPatients with psychiatric [OR] or addictive disorder that would [NOT] preclude obtaining informed consent<|eot_id|>']
