Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nscore level D on the SIGAM mobility grade \nhave experienced 1 or more falls in the last month before the study \nhave a residual limb length which does not allow for seven inches clearance of bracket attachment for the PowerFoot \nthe residual limb must be stable in volume (no change in socket or socket padding in last 6 months) and without pain that limits function \nthe sound-side (contralateral) lower extremity must be free of impediments that affect gait, range of motion, or limb muscle activity \nAny diagnosed cardiovascular, pulmonary, neurological, and/ or orthopedic conditions that would interfere with subject participation       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nscore level D on the SIGAM mobility grade \nhave experienced 1 or more falls in the last month before the study \nhave a residual limb length which does [NOT] not allow for seven inches clearance of bracket attachment for the PowerFoot \nthe residual limb must be stable in volume ([NOT] no change in socket [OR] or socket padding in last 6 months) [AND] and [NOT] without pain that [NOT] limits function \nthe sound-side (contralateral) lower extremity must be [NOT] free of impediments that affect gait, [OR] range of motion, [OR] or limb muscle activity \nAny diagnosed cardiovascular, [OR] pulmonary, [OR] neurological, [OR] and/ or orthopedic conditions that would interfere with subject participation<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
score level D on the SIGAM mobility grade 
have experienced 1 or more falls in the last month before the study 
have a residual limb length which does [NOT] not allow for seven inches clearance of bracket attachment for the PowerFoot 
the residual limb must be stable in volume ([NOT] no change in socket [OR] or socket padding in last 6 months) [AND] and [NOT] without pain that [NOT] limits function 
the sound-side (contralateral) lower extremity must be [NOT] free of impediments that affect gait, [OR] range of motion, [OR] or limb muscle activity 
Any diagnosed cardiovascular, [OR] pulmonary, [OR] neurological, [OR] and/ or orthopedic conditions that would interfere with subject participation
