ded inadequately (a score of >18 on the MADRS) to first-line antidepressant treatment of 4 week duration\nCurrent use of standard antidepressant treatment in monotherapy [OR] or combination of 2 antidepressants : escitalopram (10 - 20mg/d), fluoxetine(20 - 40mg/d), paroxetine CR(25 - 50mg/d), sertraline(100 - 150mg/d), mirtazapine (15 - 45mg/d), duloxetine (30 - 60mg/d) [OR] or venlafaxine ER(150-225mg/d)<|eot_id|>']
