reening, as calculated from the follow-up from the previous study       \n    \n\n\n### Response:\nHistory [OR] or presence of any clinically significant disease [OR] or disorder \nAny condition [OR] or disease that would render the subject unsuitable for the study, place the subject at undue risk [OR] or interfere with the ability of the subject to complete the study in the opinion of the investigator \nHistory of clinically significant hypersensitivity [OR] or allergic drug reactions \n Any suspicion [OR] or history of alcohol abuse [OR] and/or consumption of other drugs of abuse \n Regular smoker (> 5 cigarettes, > 1 pipeful [OR] or > 1 cigar per day) \n Positive for hepatitis B, [OR] hepatitis C [OR] or HIV infection \nDietary restrictions that would [NOT] prohibit the consumption of standardized meals \nParticipation in an investigational drug [OR] or device study within 90 days prior to screening, as calculated from the follow-up from the previous study<|eot_id|>']
