ge surgery within 12 hrs from hospital admission\nHistory of atrial fibrillation [OR] or muscle disease (myopathy)\nCurrent renal (creatinine>2x upper limit of normal (ULN), dialysis, kidney transplant) [OR] or hepatic dysfunction (AST/ [OR] ALT>2x ULN, liver transplant [OR] or neoplasm)\n [NOT] Inability of oral drug intake<|eot_id|>']
