 standard second-line chemotherapy [AND] and 1 EGF/ [OR] EGFR inhibitor \nEvidence of disease progression \nLife expectancy >12 weeks \nNeutrophils > 1.5 109/l, Platelets > 100 109/l, Hemoglobin > 9g/dl, Total bilirubin < 1.5 UNL, AST (SGOT) [AND] and ALT (SGPT) < 2.5 UNL, Alkaline phosphatases < 5 UNL, Creatinine < 1 UNL<|eot_id|>']
