Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nIndication for emergent cesarean or known fetal anomaly\nAnti-hypertensive therapy received in the past 12 hours\nHistory of eclampsia or other adverse CNS complication (e.g., stroke or PRES) in this pregnancy\nActively wheezing at time of enrollment or history of asthma complications\nKnown coronary artery disease or type I DM with microvascular complications or signs of heart failure or clinical dissection of the aorta\n\n\n### Response:\nIndication for emergent cesarean [OR] or known fetal anomaly\nAnti-hypertensive therapy received in the past 12 hours\nHistory of eclampsia [OR] or other adverse CNS complication (e.g., stroke [OR] or PRES) in this pregnancy\nActively wheezing at time of enrollment [OR] or history of asthma complications\nKnown coronary artery disease [OR] or type I DM [AND] with microvascular complications [OR] or signs of heart failure [OR] or clinical dissection of the aorta<|eot_id|>']
Response: Indication for emergent cesarean [OR] or known fetal anomaly
Anti-hypertensive therapy received in the past 12 hours
History of eclampsia [OR] or other adverse CNS complication (e.g., stroke [OR] or PRES) in this pregnancy
Actively wheezing at time of enrollment [OR] or history of asthma complications
Known coronary artery disease [OR] or type I DM [AND] with microvascular complications [OR] or signs of heart failure [OR] or clinical dissection of the aorta
