 carcinoma excluded) \nWHO (World Health organization) Performance status: 0, 1 or 2 \nIf cirrhosis, Child A score [AND] with total bilirubin less than 30 micromoles per liter \nCreatinine clearance more or equal to 30 mL/min \nPatient informed and consent signature obtained<|eot_id|>']
