e abortion) \nDiagnosis of gestational trophoblastic disease \nSubject unwilling [OR] or [NOT] unable to comply with study procedures \nKnown hypersensitivity to MTX \nPresence of clinical contraindications for treatment with MTX \nPrior medical [OR] or surgical management of this gestation \nSubject unwilling to accept a blood transfusion<|eot_id|>']
