Patients with Moderate [OR] to Advanced Chronic periodontitis 
Patients with 2 or more interproximal sites ([NOT] not on same tooth) with probing pocket depths of 5mm or more [AND] and 2 or more interproximal sites ([NOT] not on same tooth)of probing attachment loss of 4mm or more which bled on probing.
