Output: ['<|begin_of_text|>Below is an instruction that describes a task, paired with an input that provides further context. Write a response that appropriately completes the request.\n\n### Instruction:\nCreate an edited version of the following inclusion and exclusion criteria that incorporates the logical operators [AND], [OR], [NOT].\nApply these rules for inserting the logical operators:\n- Always write an [OR] before an "or", "and/or", "and / or" in the text.\n- Always write an [OR] after a comma "," and after "/" in the text.\n- Always write an [AND] before words like "with", "who", "in addition", "plus", "and", "but", "that", "despite", "having".\n- Always write a [NOT] before "no", "not", "none",  "don\'t", "free", "prevent", "Inability", "lack", "impossible", "off", "without", "unable", "naive", "excluded", "absence"\n\nGeneral rules:\n- The operators [OR], [AND], [NOT] should be written before the words like or, and, not.\n- An [AND], [OR], [NOT] must not come before a line segment (\\n).\n- Please carefully read through the given criteria text, then output only an edited version with the logical operators incorporated, enclosed in <EDITED_CRITERIA> tags.\n- Do not include any other explanations or output.\n\n\n### Input:\nPatients presenting for abdominal myomectomy with documented uterine fibroids on pelvic imaging (pelvic ultrasound or MRI) within in last 12 months\nAge = 18 years and = 50 years\nPre-operative hemoglobin >8 g/dl\nWilling to have buccal administration of misoprostol or a placebo at least one hour pre-procedure.\nAbility to understand and the willingness to sign a written informed consent.\nAdmissible medical/surgical history\nCan be previously treated with Depo-Lupron, Depo-Provera, or Oral Contraceptive pills\nIntraoperative use of vasopressin and uterine tourniquet is permissible\nCan have had prior Cesarean delivery\n\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\nPatients presenting for abdominal myomectomy [AND] with documented uterine fibroids on pelvic imaging (pelvic ultrasound [OR] or MRI) within in last 12 months\nAge = 18 years [AND] and = 50 years\nPre-operative hemoglobin >8 g/dl\nWilling to have buccal administration of misoprostol [OR] or a placebo at least one hour pre-procedure.\nAbility to understand and the willingness to sign a written informed consent.\nAdmissible medical/ [OR] surgical history\nCan be previously treated with Depo-Lupron, [OR] Depo-Provera, [OR] or Oral Contraceptive pills\nIntraoperative use of vasopressin [OR] and uterine tourniquet is permissible\nCan have had prior Cesarean delivery<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
Patients presenting for abdominal myomectomy [AND] with documented uterine fibroids on pelvic imaging (pelvic ultrasound [OR] or MRI) within in last 12 months
Age = 18 years [AND] and = 50 years
Pre-operative hemoglobin >8 g/dl
Willing to have buccal administration of misoprostol [OR] or a placebo at least one hour pre-procedure.
Ability to understand and the willingness to sign a written informed consent.
Admissible medical/ [OR] surgical history
Can be previously treated with Depo-Lupron, [OR] Depo-Provera, [OR] or Oral Contraceptive pills
Intraoperative use of vasopressin [OR] and uterine tourniquet is permissible
Can have had prior Cesarean delivery
